<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Lusomundo H1 net 340 mln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Lusomundo H1 net 340 mln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to June 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net profit 0.340 vs 0.518 cons net loss</p>
<p>Cons net profit after minority interests 0.232 vs 0.512 loss</p>
<p>Turnover 16.87 vs 12.89</p>
<p>Cash flow 2.16 vs 2.02</p>
<p>Note - Entertainment and media group Lusomundo-Sociedade Gestora de Participacoes Sociais said it expected to post a full-year consolidated net profit after minority interests of 776 million escudos after posting a 614 million loss in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
